From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emaki contributors <emaki@localhost>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 17:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Add per-workspace indexed ring wallpaper and living trains

Keep lifetime workspace starts and physical camera motion through rebases.
Decode indexed art on a worker; use a palette atlas when the queried GPU
limit permits and tiled storage otherwise. Retain opaque ring and foreground
layers below Bottom surfaces and include these static layers in xray blur.
Animate trains and puffs only while visible, with entry/spawn deadlines,
lock/screenshot suspension, config reload recovery and renderer ownership.

Add config, asset, layout, scheduler and software-GLES regressions.
Generated from git diff 52468d28; no commit or index mutation.
